  "prefLabel": "Env-C 213.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 213.02 Applicability. Unless otherwise specified, Env-C 213 shall apply to the procurement of goods and services by the New Hampshire department of environmental services through a request for bid (RFB), request for application (RFA), request for proposal (RFP), or similar invitation.\n\nSource. #12386, eff 9-22-17",
